[00:01.08]制作人：文驰Vinchi(HOYO-MiX）
[00:01.54]Carved on stones
[00:06.50]Buried deep in the earth
[00:11.94]Long submerged beneath waterfalls
[00:21.10]Triggering a thunderstorm
[00:27.31]Summoning gusts of wind
[00:31.50]Seething waves of sea slapping on the reefs
[00:42.34]To make a Voice
[00:44.16]Tell us what to believe without any doubt
[00:49.97]Without any doubt never let us down
[00:54.65]Tell us when to depart for a promise true
[01:00.66]For a promise true despite the day of doom
[01:10.58]A bloodline stretches out one more inch with every heartbeat
[01:25.19]Reaches a fingertip that has been staying at the words on the page
[01:37.38]We have grown up before taking heart of grace
[01:43.30]Taking heart of grace is how we blaze a way
[01:47.92]We still struggle against the fear of being unarmed
[01:53.70]The fear of being unarmed keeps our frailty apart
[02:11.21]No one would be able to look down upon this world
[02:22.58]So one is allowed to be born
[02:38.81]We've known what to believe without any doubt
[02:44.73]Without any doubt never let us down
[02:49.30]We have taken the road for a promise true
[02:55.23]For a promise true despite the day of doom
